 Glow", "step_text": "<p>Seal it all in for a radiant, healthy finish.</p>"}}}, "block_order": ["step_prep", "step_treat", "step_lock"], "settings": {"title": "Build Your Ritual", "heading_size": "h1", "description": "<p>Three simple steps to clean, radiant skin — mix and match to build a routine that fits you.</p>", "color_scheme": "scheme-2", "show_cta": true, "cta_label": "Shop the Full Ritual", "cta_link": "/collections/all", "padding_top": 48, "padding_bottom": 48}}, "multirow_ftq6YR": {"type": "multirow", "blocks": {"row_story_1": {"type": "row", "settings": {"caption": "Our Story", "heading": "Founded on a Simple Idea", "text": "<p>Thessvane started with a simple frustration: skincare shouldn't require a chemistry degree to understand. We formulate with naturally derived ingredients, skip the synthetic filler, and keep every routine simple enough to actually stick to.</p>", "button_label": "Learn More", "button_link": "/pages/about"}}, "row_story_2": {"type": "row", "settings": {"caption": "How We Make It", "heading": "Small-Batch, Thoughtfully Made", "text": "<p>Every formula is developed in small batches and tested for how it actually feels on skin — not just how it looks on a label. Clean ingredients, dermatologist-tested, and never rushed.</p>", "button_label": "", "button_link": ""}}}, "block_order": ["row_story_1", "row_story_2"], "settings": {"image_height": "medium", "desktop_image_width": "medium", "heading_size": "h1", "text_style": "body", "button_style": "primary", "desktop_content_position": "middle", "desktop_content_alignment": "left", "image_layout": "alternate-left", "section_color_scheme": "scheme-1", "row_color_scheme": "scheme-1", "mobile_content_alignment": "left", "padding_top": 60, "padding_bottom": 60}}, "c65117da-b894-43a0-8d4d-7bd214ab10a9": {"type": "ds-testimonials", "blocks": {"column_maya": {"type": "column", "settings": {"title": "Finally, a routine that works", "text": "<p>My skin feels calmer and looks brighter within two weeks. Nothing harsh, nothing complicated — just results.</p>", "author": "Maya R."}}, "column_priya": {"type": "column", "settings": {"title": "Gentle enough for sensitive skin", "text": "<p>I've tried so many “clean” brands that still broke me out. Thessvane is the first one that's actually gentle.</p>", "author": "Priya K."}}, "column_jordan": {"type": "column", "settings": {"title": "Clean ingredients, real results", "text": "<p>I can pronounce every ingredient and my skin has never looked better. That's the whole point, right?</p>", "author": "Jordan L."}}}, "block_order": ["column_maya", "column_priya", "column_jordan"], "settings": {"title": "What Our Customers Are Saying", "heading_size": "h2", "text": "", "image_width": "full", "image_ratio": "circle", "columns_desktop": 3, "slider_preview": true, "column_alignment": "center", "show_stars": true, "stars_color": "#B9A98F", "show_quotes": true, "quotes_color_scheme": "background-1", "background_style": "none", "color_scheme": "custom", "padding_top": 32, "padding_bottom": 32, "custom_colors_background": "#FDFBF7", "custom_gradient_background": "", "custom_colors_text": "#2B2A4A"}}, "thessvane_ingredient_callout": {"type": "thessvane-ingredient-callout", "settings": {"layout": "image_first", "eyebrow": "Why Clean Ingredients", "heading": "Nothing Hidden. Nothing Harsh.", "heading_size": "h1", "text": "<p>Every Thessvane formula starts with naturally derived ingredients and skips the synthetic fragrances, sulfates, and fillers common in mass-market skincare. Clean doesn't mean compromise — it means a routine you can trust, morning and night.</p>", "button_label": "Our Ingredients", "button_link": "/pages/about", "button_style_secondary": false, "section_color_scheme": "scheme-2", "color_scheme": "scheme-2", "padding_top": 0, "padding_bottom": 0}}, "thessvane_ugc_grid": {"type": "thessvane-ugc-grid", "blocks": {"tile_1": {"type": "tile", "settings": {"handle": "@thessvane"}}, "tile_2": {"type": "tile", "settings": {